    "conditions": "n>=2, affected-set independent selected block, 0<r0<r1, beta*r0>=3/4.",
    "rescaled_limit": "With a->0+, beta/log(1/a)->b and b*r0>1, the a^-4 residual vanishes for varying periods, blocks and exterior configurations. The correctly rescaled retained-law MSE also vanishes.",
